    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: MAR22.39 first sentence",
      "summary": "MAR22.39, in the CTP section, says the maturity scaling and offsetting rules apply to securitisations \"(non-CTP)\", a label copied from MAR22.30.",
      "impact": "Position: CTP index tranche long 1y+ and short 3M same tranche Reading a: Literal: maturity scaling applies only to non-CTP so CTP short is unscaled: net 0 Reading b: Intended: CTP scaled 1/4: net long 75% of notional Difference: 75 of 100",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
